Subject: Revert "Fix POSIX conformance of old SysV names"

This reverts commit c6926930728d81556e3406c4a6328a3b229b386d.

We do not want to make these backward-compatibility zones selectable for
users, nor move them from tzdata-legacy to tzdata. Just revert the
upstream change.

